                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Very light recommend. Obviously inspired by the DQ games but has its own tone, especially with the switching worlds mechanic, though the colorful world is more appealing than black and white.\r\n\r\nBeat the game in 4:48 (in game time), its pretty easy, not much to combat, pretty much buff and debuff for two turns or so, spam the few magic and attacks available, heal from time to time and thats it. I'd say this is the weakest of the Torch60 games.",
